    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="idp116750784">tug</headword>
      <description>spark. Cha’n’eil mi faighinn tig [sic] ás. This term used in the instance of a car engine or any engine refusing to start. [SLIP: Spark – e.g. of car engine.] [NOTES: the quotation on the slip – ‘Chan eil mi faighinn tug às.’]</description>
    </item>
